; kilim.router.browser (design section 06): the history driver of kilim.router
; on the History API of the browser, with Brr. main.ml calls
; Kilim_router_browser.install (). It uses kilim.router, kilim.web and Brr only,
; and none of Printf, Format, Scanf, Str, Hashtbl, Random, Fun or Printexc
; (test/link). windtrap runs only native code, thus test/dom/guards.txt lists
; the guards of this library with their tests.

(library
 (name kilim_router_browser)
 (public_name kilim.router.browser)
 (flags
  (:standard -w +50))
 (libraries kilim kilim.router kilim.web brr))
